        <item>
            <title>0.15.24</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 16:15:05 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>185</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.24</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>A failed atomic file-swap during audio compaction or the playback-format rewrite could delete a recording&#x27;s audio instead of leaving it untouched. The swap now always keeps the original intact on any failure.</li>
<li>Added a database index on segments-by-speaker, speeding up speaker merge/reassign and the meeting-list preview on large libraries.</li>
<li>Settings cancels a pending debounced save when the panel unmounts.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
