        <item>
            <title>0.15.22</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 11:44:23 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>183</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.22</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Recordings take far less disk. The `system_sck.wav` backup track — a second far-end capture that is always silent (48 kHz stereo, hundreds of MB on a long call) — is no longer written, and any left by older builds are cleaned up automatically on launch.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
